🎓 Program 7 — Store Student Records in a Text File

📌 Description

This program demonstrates how to store student information permanently in a text file.

Student details such as roll number, name, and marks are written using a simple delimiter-based format. The program uses append mode so that new records can be added without removing existing records.

🔑 Concepts Covered

- 🎓 Student record management
- 💾 Persistent data storage
- ➕ Appending records
- 📝 Delimiter-based file format
- 📂 Text-file handling

📁 File Created

"students.txt"

🧠 Main C++ Features

"ofstream", "std::ios::app", and delimiter-based records
